; GR II TTY loader (copy to H:/Startup.ttl; needs PROPID_DEVEL_MODE=1)
; ASCII, CRLF, uppercase drive letters.
;
; Prerequisite: the M0 probe (loader/probe/) showed the window
; 0xA0017000-0xA001EFFF still 0xFF at boot AND at shutdown.
; Load once per power cycle (re-loading over executed code needs an I-cache flush).
;
; fload <file> <addr_hex> <max_size_hex>: fread stops at EOF; 8000 = window size.
; ex needs the 0x prefix (C-style radix); bit 0 set = Thumb entry.
; Payload log: H:/tty/tty_log.txt (release build: errors only; debug build: everything).

sprintf "fload H:/cfw/gr2_cfw.bin A0017000 8000"
sendln inputstr
sprintf "ex 0xA0017001"
sendln inputstr

end
